1,Kaonde Language (KQN) – L1 & L2 Speakers... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/kqn/,"Kaonde is a stable indigenous language of Zambia and the Democratic Republic of the Congo. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community.",Kaonde,Niger-Congo
